// Each aircraft drawn on the player's deck is a member of the wing. It launches (jets run off the bow, helicopters lift straight up),
// joins the air war as a friendly unit (enemy fighters can hunt it and shoot it down), picks its own targets - enemy aircraft first for
// jets, ships, tanks and boats for helicopters - attacks with guns and homing missiles, patrols when there is nothing to fight, and comes
