// ---------- v3.8 performance overlay (F3): where every frame's time goes, measured on the player's own machine ----------
// CPU: the game update and the draw submission, timed with performance.now. GPU: each part of the picture timed on the graphics card
// with EXT_disjoint_timer_query_webgl2 (where the browser offers it). Stutters: frames over 25 / 50 ms in the last 10 s.
